Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/gregbook/rpng2-win.c
Line: 1016
Function: rpng2_win_load_bg_image
Bug type: divide-by-zero
CWE: CWE-369
Explanation: s is computed using a division by (hw + hh). For a 1x1 image, hw == 0 and hh == 0, so (hw + hh) == 0, causing a division by zero.

